  reel_script says the prisoner threw sand/dust in the police's eyes (கண்ணில் மண்ணைத் தூவி) to escape; the article only says he escaped without the knowledge of police and court staff, with no such detail.
  reel_script says the escaped man was taken back to court (மீண்டும் நீதிமன்றத்தில் ஆஜர்படுத்தப்பட்டார) — the article says he was brought to court and produced, which is roughly correct, but reel_script omits the article's point that he was then returned to the Namakkal branch jail; the closing 'மீண்டும்' mismatch is minor.
  reel_script says 'எஸ்.நாட்டாமங்கலம் அருகே' while the article specifies 'எஸ்.நாட்டாமங்கலம் கூத்தமூப்பன்பட்டி ஊராட்சி ஒன்றிய தொடக்கப் பள்ளி' — the location is altered from a specific school/panchayat to a vague 'near', which misstates the article.
  slides_spec 'போலி காசோலை வழங்கிய புகாரில் 13 அக்டோபர் கைது' invents the month 'அக்டோபர்'; the article only says the 13th of an unspecified month (the posting date is not a claim from the article).
  caption says the prisoner was arrested on the 13th and 'நாமக்கல் கிளை சிறையில் அடைக்கப்பட்டிருந்தார்' — consistent, but the caption also says the escaped prisoner was 'விசாரணைக்கு அழைத்து வரப்பட்ட' correctly; no issue here.
  reel_script states the teacher works 'தொடக்கப் பள்ளி ஆசிரியராகப் பணியாற்றுபவர்' near S.Nattamangalam, dropping the article's Koothamoopanpatti village panchayat union school detail, which is an important identifying fact.
  reel_script omits that the prisoner was arrested in relation to passing a fake cheque in exchange for money from several people (பணம் பெற்று போலி காசோலை), reducing the cause to a generic complaint.
  reel_script says the policemen were 'கவனக்குறைவாக இருந்த காவலர்கள்' and that the superintendent 'விசாரணை நடத்தியவர்' — the article names him as Yadav Girish Ashok; the reel omits the name, but this is not an invented fact. The article's statement that he was 'சில மணி நேரங்களில்' caught is kept; no problem.
